m, he is left with no other choice, and Seizaki puts his plan for kidnapping Itsuki into motion. However, something unusual had begun to happen under the surface.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pHMTX2ParzARa2BreKrlUxy5P9z.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"The public was overcome with shock after discovering the identity of the boy who appeared in the public debate. When Nomaru’s opponents use his secret weapon against him, he is left with no other choice, and Seizaki puts his plan for kidnapping Itsuki into motion. However, something unusual had begun to happen under the surface.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pHMTX2ParzARa2BreKrlUxy5P9z.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101349","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37525","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92599","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"369143","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"35813","synopsis":"After the parliamentary election, Shiniki was preparing to enact the suicide law. After his kidnap attempt on Itsuki, Seizaki is put under house arrest and spends his days overcome with a sense of powerlessness. One day, Seizaki is paid a visit by an important individual.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sxh7YuSK0y2gnI4NJr8CPQVpFdY.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"After the parliamentary election, Shiniki was preparing to enact the suicide law. After his kidnap attempt on Itsuki, Seizaki is put under house arrest and spends his days overcome with a sense of powerlessness. One day, Seizaki is paid a visit by an important individual.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sxh7YuSK0y2gnI4NJ