 Flores in a hospice. Meanwhile, Seizaki receives a report saying that Germany and Italy have also adopted the suicide law. In the midst of the confusion, something unbelievable happens right in front of their eyes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/38gzGL6dXOcj6czDX6xKWw0Fam7.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Seizaki and Hardy listen to the recording of the telephone call with Flores in a hospice. Meanwhile, Seizaki receives a report saying that Germany and Italy have also adopted the suicide law. In the midst of the confusion, something unbelievable happens right in front of their eyes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/38gzGL6dXOcj6czDX6xKWw0Fam7.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13948","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"101349","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37525","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"92599","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"369143","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"37046","synopsis":"The beginning of the G7 summit has arrived. The leaders of the seven countries, which now contain cities that have adopted the suicide law, gather together and share their stances on the suicide law. While the leaders debate the issue from the perspective of morality, economics, and rights, Alex poses a single question that cuts to the heart of the debate.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kXqnnU4ET1FyvALEz54TfcoFrAb.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"The beginning of the G7 summit has arrived. The leaders of the seven countries, which now contain cities that have adopted the suicide law, gather together and share their stances on the suicide law. While the leaders debate the issue